From b69748c19c58badf76d550dc2fecb568f145b9d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Santos <lsantos7654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 12:16:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] feat: auto-attribute MCP inbox sends to caller session

Inject _opencode_session into args when invoking hivemind MCP tools so
the receiving subprocess always knows the calling session ID, and
prepend [From: ses_xxx] to inbox-delivered text when sender_id is
populated. Restricted to MCP tool keys starting with 'hivemind_' to
avoid leaking opencode internals into third-party MCP servers.

Closes the regression introduced by 0028 where sender_id was persisted
but never surfaced in the delivered prompt.
---
 packages/opencode/src/session/inbox.ts        |  3 +-
 packages/opencode/src/session/prompt.ts       |  5 +-
 .../test/server/session-actions.test.ts       | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/opencode/src/session/inbox.ts b/packages/opencode/src/session/inbox.ts
index 84f74bb..b852cc1 100644
